cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this benchmark or its results, please cite it as below.
title: "Baseweight Benchmark: an evaluation harness for comparing fine-tuned open models with frontier APIs"
abstract: "An evaluation harness for comparing QLoRA fine-tuned open-weight models against frontier API baselines under training-data-constrained conditions. Task and model configurations are declarative, and each run reports accuracy, latency, cost per query and total cost of ownership alongside raw predictions."
type: software
authors:
